<view class="page with-tab community-page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="between" style="height:96rpx"><view><view class="top-title-main">经历社群</view><view class="top-title-sub">真实经历仅供参考，不替代安全判断</view></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="search-icon">⌕</text><input class="grow" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索地区、场景或处理方式"/><text class="muted">筛选</text></view><view class="chip-row" style="margin-top:26rpx"><view wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{filter===item?'active':''}}" data-v="{{item}}" bindtap="filter">{{item}}</view></view>
<view class="stack gap-12" style="margin-top:36rpx"><view wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" class="card post-card {{index === 0 ? 'featured-post' : ''}} {{index === 1 ? 'review-post' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><view class="circle {{index?'circle-amber':'circle-green'}}" style="width:72rpx;height:72rpx">{{item.initial}}</view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:20rpx"><view class="h3 post-author">{{item.author}}</view><view class="tiny post-place">{{item.region}} · {{item.type}} · {{item.stage}}</view></view><view class="chip active {{index === 1 ? 'review-chip' : ''}}">{{index?'待复查':'经验分享'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{index > 1}}" class="h3 post-title">{{item.title}}</view><view wx:if="{{index === 0}}" class="muted post-text">穿过草木茂密路段后发现小腿有两处红点，<text class="block-break"></text>先清洁并冷敷，按提醒复查时没有继续扩大。</view><view wx:elif="{{index === 1}}" class="muted post-text">夜间整理帐篷时手背突然刺痒，没有看到虫体。<text class="block-break"></text>通过环境与症状问答完成判断，准备两小时后复查。</view><view wx:else class="muted post-text">{{item.text}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.route}}" class="route-snippet"><view>路线：{{item.route}}</view><view wx:if="{{index === 0}}" class="route-habitat">林地 · 近水 · 草木茂密</view><text>查看</text></view><view wx:if="{{index === 1}}" class="post-meta review-meta"><text class="review-status">待复查</text><text>♡ {{item.likes}}</text><text>评论 {{item.comments}}</text></view><view wx:else class="post-meta"><text>♡ {{item.likes}}</text><text>评论 {{item.comments}}</text><text>收藏 {{item.favorites}}</text><text>分享</text></view></view></view>
<view class="safe-note community-note">社区内容是个人经验，不应作为诊断或治疗依据</view><view class="publish-fab" bindtap="publish"><image class="publish-circle" src="/assets/figma/all/s21-imgEllipse2.svg"/><text class="plus">＋</text><text class="publish-label">发布</text></view></view>
